{#
  The <head> every page shares. Before this existed the same 30-odd tags
  were maintained in four files, which is how a canonical or an og:url
  quietly goes stale on one page and nobody notices for a month.

  Structural bits (viewport, icons, which stylesheets) come from the page
  entry in site.json, because they are not translatable. Everything a
  reader or a crawler actually reads comes from the content file.

  IMPORTANT: tokens.css must be first in `page.head.styles`. base.css and
  page.css no longer define the palette (#128), so a page that loads them
  without it renders with every var() invalid.

  The *Note fields exist because this component replaces a page's whole head,
  and build:check deliberately ignores HTML comments. A comment that lived in
  a hand-written head would therefore disappear without failing anything. Draw
  carries one explaining why its <title> says "Imposter" with an e; it survives
  only because it was moved into site.json. Audit for these before migrating a
  page, not after.
#}
{% macro head(c, page, site, url, locale) %}
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
{% include "components/clarity.njk" %}
{% if page.head.viewportNote %}
<!-- {{ page.head.viewportNote | safe }} -->
{% endif %}
<meta name="viewport" content="{{ page.head.viewport }}" />
{% if page.head.titleNote %}
<!-- {{ page.head.titleNote | safe }} -->
{% endif %}
<title>{{ c.title | safe }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ c.description | safe }}">
<meta name="keywords" content="{{ c.keywords | safe }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ url }}">
<meta name="robots" content="max-image-preview:large">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#FBF8F3">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/icons/icon-48.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="/icons/icon-96.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="192x192" href="/icons/icon-192.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ page.head.appleTouchIcon }}">
<link rel="manifest" href="{{ page.head.manifest }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ c.ogTitle | safe }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ c.ogDescription | safe }}">
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ c.ogImage | safe }}">
{% if c.ogImageWidth %}
<meta property="og:image:width" content="{{ c.ogImageWidth }}">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="{{ c.ogImageHeight }}">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="{{ c.ogImageAlt | safe }}">
{% endif %}
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ url }}">
<meta property="og:type" content="{{ page.head.ogType }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Impostor Games">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ c.twitterTitle | safe }}">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ c.twitterDescription | safe }}">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ c.twitterImage | safe }}">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="{{ site.fontsHref }}" rel="stylesheet">
{% if page.head.stylesNote %}
<!-- {{ page.head.stylesNote | safe }} -->
{% endif %}
{% for href in page.head.styles %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ href }}">
{% endfor %}
{% endmacro %}
